## 2️⃣ @mapbox/mapbox-gl-geocoder  →  search box

| What changes? | How to fix it |
|---------------|---------------|
| **Package name** – the Mapbox geocoder plugin is tightly coupled to the Mapbox Geocoding API (requires an access token). | Replace it with the MapLibre-compatible fork **`@maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder`**. |
| **Geocoding service** – you must point the new plugin at an open geocoder (Nominatim, Photon, Pelias, MapTiler Geocoding, etc.). | Choose a service, add its endpoint to the plugin options, and remove any `accessToken` reference. |
| **CSS** – the original plugin’s CSS uses the `mapboxgl-` prefix. The MapLibre fork ships its own CSS (`maplibregl-`), so just import the new CSS. | `import '@maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder/dist/maplibre-gl-geocoder.css';` |
| **Token removal** – any `mapboxgl.accessToken = '…'` line should be deleted. | Done automatically when you drop the Mapbox token. |

### Minimal code change

```bash
npm uninstall @mapbox/mapbox-gl-geocoder
npm i @maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder
```

```js
// 1️⃣ Imports
import * as maplibregl from 'maplibre-gl';
import MaplibreGeocoder from '@maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder';
import '@maplibre/maplibre-gl-geocoder/dist/maplibre-gl-geocoder.css';
import 'maplibre-gl/dist/maplibre-gl.css';

// 2️⃣ Map (same as above)
const map = new maplibregl.Map({
  container: 'map',
  style: 'https://tiles.openfreemap.org/styles/liberty',
  center: [-122.42, 37.78],
  zoom: 12
});

// 3️⃣ Choose a geocoder service
// Example: OpenStreetMap Nominatim (public demo – not for production)
const geocoder = new MaplibreGeocoder({
  // No `accessToken` field
  placeholder: 'Search places',
  // The `url` points to the Nominatim endpoint
  // (you can replace this with your own Nominatim, Photon, MapTiler, etc.)
  url: 'https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/search',
  // Nominatim returns `display_name` – map it to the `text` field MapLibre expects
  // The plugin already knows how to parse Nominatim, so no extra mapping needed.
  // If you use a different service, you may need to provide a `transformResponse`
  // function (see the plugin README).
  // Optional: limit results, language, etc.
  limit: 5,
  language: 'en'
});

// 4️⃣ Add the control to the map
map.addControl(geocoder);
```

#### Production-ready geocoder options
| Service | URL (example) | Notes |
|---------|---------------|-------|
| **Nominatim (self-hosted)** | `https://my-nominatim.example.org/search` | Free, OSM attribution required. Public `nominatim.openstreetmap.org` is rate-limited – not for production. |
| **MapTiler Geocoding** | `https://api.maptiler.com/geocoding/{query}.json?key=YOUR_KEY` | Requires a MapTiler API key (free tier available). |
| **Photon** | `https://photon.komoot.io/api/` | Open, fast, but also rate-limited on the public instance. |
| **Pelias** | `https://pelias.example.com/v1/search` | Self-host or use a managed provider. |

When you switch to any of those, just change the `url` option (and add the key if required). The rest of the code stays identical.

